# Machine-generated by pnpm — its own writer controls quoting/indentation.
# Reformatting it just fights every subsequent `pnpm install`, and it isn't
# gitignored (lockfiles are tracked), so prettier picks it up by default.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Written by semantic-release's changelog plugin on every release, in the
# conventional-changelog format (`*` bullets), which prettier would rewrite to
# `-` and so fail `prettier --check` after each release. The org's other repos
# ignore it for the same reason.
CHANGELOG.md

# Posted verbatim to a Discord channel (holocron#1533). Prettier drops the angle brackets around a link
# address, and Discord uses them to keep a link from expanding into a preview card.
RULES.md
